  {
   "id": "cielo",
   "fondo": "cielo",
   "camara": {
    "de": 0,
    "a": 0,
    "zoom": [
     1,
     1.1
    ]
   },
   "frases": [
    {
     "es": "Del cráneo de Ymir hicieron el cielo, una enorme cúpula sobre la tierra.",
     "en": "From Ymir's skull they made the sky, a huge dome over the earth."
    },
    {
     "es": "Esparcieron sus sesos por el aire, y se volvieron las nubes.",
     "en": "They scattered his brains in the air, and they became the clouds."
    },
    {
     "es": "Pero el cielo era pesado, y alguien tenía que sostenerlo.",
     "en": "But the sky was heavy, and someone had to hold it up."
    },
    {
     "es": "Así que los dioses pusieron cuatro enanos, uno en cada esquina, para sostener el cielo.",
     "en": "So the gods placed four dwarves, one at each corner, to hold up the sky."
    },
    {
     "es": "Se llaman Nordri, Sudri, Austri y Vestri: Norte, Sur, Este y Oeste.",
     "en": "Their names are Nordri, Sudri, Austri and Vestri: North, South, East and West."
    },
    {
     "es": "Así el cielo quedó en lo alto, sobre la tierra.",
     "en": "So the sky stayed high above the earth."
    }
   ],
