   "frases": [
    {
     "es": "A los gigantes les dieron las costas lejanas de la tierra, junto al mar profundo.",
     "en": "The giants were given the far shores of the land, beside the deep sea."
    },
    {
     "es": "Pero los gigantes eran enemigos de los dioses, así que había que proteger el centro del mundo.",
     "en": "But the giants were enemies of the gods, so the middle of the world had to be kept safe."
    },
    {
     "es": "Por eso los dioses levantaron un muro alrededor, hecho con las cejas de Ymir.",
     "en": "So the gods built a wall all around it, made from Ymir's eyebrows."
    },
    {
     "es": "Ese lugar seguro se llamó Midgard, y se hizo para las personas.",
     "en": "That safe place was called Midgard, and it was made for people."
    }
   ],
