   },
   "frases": [
    {
     "es": "Un día, Odín, Vili y Ve caminaban por la orilla y encontraron dos troncos arrastrados por el mar.",
     "en": "One day, Odin, Vili and Ve were walking along the shore and found two logs washed up by the sea."
    },
    {
     "es": "Los troncos no tenían aliento, mente, sangre ni color. Los dioses los moldearon en un hombre y una mujer.",
     "en": "The logs had no breath, no mind, no blood and no color. The gods shaped them into a man and a woman."
    },
    {
     "es": "Odín les dio aliento, que es la vida.",
     "en": "Odin gave them breath, which is life."
    },
    {
     "es": "Vili les dio la mente, y Ve les dio la sangre y el color de la vida.",
     "en": "Vili gave them mind, and Ve gave them blood and the color of life."
    },
    {
     "es": "El hombre se llamó Ask, y la mujer se llamó Embla.",
     "en": "The man was named Ask, and the woman was named Embla."
    },
    {
     "es": "Así nacieron el primer hombre y la primera mujer, y de ellos vienen todas las personas.",
     "en": "So the first man and the first woman were born, and all people come from them."
    }
   ],
